  "origin": "A processed Danish-English sentence-pair subset harvested from OPUS (opus.nlpl.eu), selected for permissive Creative Commons or public-domain-style licensing and converted to JSONL.GZ for DFM/HRM-Text training. Schema: {id, da, en, source}. Sources include DGT (EU Directorate-General for Translation memory, e.g. EU treaties), among other OPUS da-en corpora. Intended to preserve the exact rows used by the local DFM data pipeline so DFM8 can be rebuilt without local-only files. Form: reformatted. Contributed 2.90B sampled tokens per epoch to the DFM Mimir v1 corpus (4.12%). OPUS aggregates many corpora with different licenses; this subset was filtered to permissive-licensed sources only. Users must consult OPUS and original source-corpus metadata for source-specific license details.",
